            "title": "2026 CX Season!",
            "summary": "Whoa the 2026 CX season is almost over and I didn't even post anything! Joined a bunch of my local riding buddies on the newly formed Velo City Riders Racing (VCRR) cycling team and we went all in on cyclocross for the season. Videos are on youtube and instagram, watch me have good starts and bad finishes pretty much the whole season! In other news, there were seven (7)&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>Whoa the 2026 CX season is almost over and I didn't even post anything! Joined a bunch of my local riding buddies on the newly formed Velo City Riders Racing (VCRR) cycling team and we went all in on cyclocross for the season. Videos are on youtube and instagram, watch me have good starts and bad finishes pretty much the whole season!</p>\n<p>In other news, there were seven (7) tandems at Rockburn Cyclocross this year. Incredible!</p>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d1_IrPZj7sM\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<p>Anyways maybe this space will be updated more or something as I remember to do things!</p>",
