            "id": "https://nevershiftdown.com/garage-racing-2026.html",
            "url": "https://nevershiftdown.com/garage-racing-2026.html",
            "title": "Garage Racing 2026",
            "summary": "The Garage Racing National Championships put on by CXHairs and National Landing is one of my favorite events! Rear camera of my first lap in the Men's National Championship Race: Repping Velo City Riders Racing team! Flamingo power in the Team Relay! Tried taking some photos during the Fixed Gear National Championship.",
            "content_html": "<figure>The Garage Racing National Championships put on by CXHairs and National Landing is one of my favorite events!</figure>\n<figure>Rear camera of my first lap in the Men's National Championship Race:</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VkQTtqy14KA\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/DSC09106_-_Copy-1~2.jpg\" data-size=\"5000x2813\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/DSC09106_-_Copy-1~2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Men's National Championship\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>Repping Velo City Riders Racing team!</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/img_5618.jpg\" data-size=\"1443x2041\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/img_5618-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Team Relay\" width=\"768\" height=\"1086\"></a>\n<figcaption>Flamingo power in the Team Relay!</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Tried taking some photos during the Fixed Gear National Championship.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1780_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3401x2278\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1780_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Fixed Gear Race Winner\" width=\"768\" height=\"515\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1788_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3598x2563\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1788_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Fixed Gear 2nd Place\" width=\"768\" height=\"547\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1792_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3342x2278\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1792_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"523\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1794_01.jpg\" data-size=\"2736x2333\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1794_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"655\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1797_01.jpg\" data-size=\"4528x2775\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1797_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"471\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1802_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3313x2658\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1802_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"616\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1808_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3308x2170\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1808_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"Styling riding the top tube\" width=\"768\" height=\"504\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1817_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3282x2224\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1817_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"520\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1824_01.jpg\" data-size=\"3424x2584\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1824_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"580\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1825_01.jpg\" data-size=\"4120x2718\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/13//gallery/IMGP1825_01-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"More Fixed Gear\" width=\"768\" height=\"507\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
