            "title": "Falkorburg CX",
            "summary": "Another rainy forecast turned into another dry course at Falkorburg CX. Had a great time regardless at one of my favorite local courses! Didn't quite have the legs I hoped for but still battled for every position.",
            "content_html": "<p>Another rainy forecast turned into another dry course at Falkorburg CX. Had a great time regardless at one of my favorite local courses! Didn't quite have the legs I hoped for but still battled for every position.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T1OWZVoJjeA\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
