        {
            "id": "https://nevershiftdown.com/charm-day-2.html",
            "url": "https://nevershiftdown.com/charm-day-2.html",
            "title": "Charm City Day 2",
            "summary": "Back to back race days at Charm City! It rained overnight, but nowhere near as much as expected. Some slick corners for the early morning 4/5 race, but not the mudfest I hoped for. Got a front row starting spot after some noshows and had one of the best laps of my life off the front, trying to hold a steady pace instead of blowing myself up. Finished 13th!",
            "content_html": "<p>Back to back race days at Charm City! It rained overnight, but nowhere near as much as expected. Some slick corners for the early morning 4/5 race, but not the mudfest I hoped for. Got a front row starting spot after some noshows and had one of the best laps of my life off the front, trying to hold a steady pace instead of blowing myself up. Finished 13th!</p>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AMKFsaNAGZw\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
            "image": "https://nevershiftdown.com/media/posts/11/DAY2HOLESHOT_4.2.2.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Mark Williams"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "CX"
            ],
            "date_published": "2025-11-15T09:15:59-05:00",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-15T09:16:15-05:00"
        },
        {
