            "title": "Charm City Day 1",
            "summary": "Day 1 of the Cat 4/5 race at Charm City Cyclocross in Druid Hill Park was awesome! Lots of tech, lots of features, lots of climbing, and the iconic stairs and mansion hill off-camber made for a challenging and fun race!",
