            "title": "Cross is here! Ed Sanders CX 2025",
            "summary": "Great start to the 2025 MABRA Cyclocross Season at Vanish Brewing at the Ed Sanders Memorial Cyclocross race. Very bumpy course with lots of twists, turns, and spirals! Started third row and didn't make the holeshot, finished midpack at 20th/40",
